- ### Writing a Showable
+ ### Scrivere uno Showable

- `Showable` is a typeclass with a single method, so an instance is a function from the value
- to its text:
+ `Showable` è una typeclass con un solo metodo, quindi un'istanza è una funzione dal valore al
+ suo testo:

= to its text:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- given moneyShowable: (Money is Showable) = money => t"£${money.pence/100}.${money.pence%100}"
+ given moneyShowable: (Money is Showable) = money => t"£${money.pence/100}.${money.pence%100}"

= given moneyShowable: (Money is Showable) = money => t"£${money.pence/100}.${money.pence%100}"
- ```
+ ```

= given moneyShowable: (Money is Showable) = money => t"£${money.pence/100}.${money.pence%100}"
= ```
=
